73-Maintainers during this time span: @ccadar, @MartinNowack, @251.
74-Documentation at https://klee-se.org/releases/docs/v3.1
75-
76-== Major features and important changes ==
77-- New execution tree implementation and klee-exec-tree tool (@251)
78-- KDAlloc is now the default allocator in KLEE (KDAlloc was introduced in KLEE 3.0)
79-- Resolve memory reads/writes to single objects in more cases (@tkuchta)
80-- Concretize values based on seeds when available (@ccadar)
81-- Fixed some interactions with external code (@ccadar, @MartinNowack, mishok2503)
82-
83:== LLVM support ==
84:- Current recommended version is still LLVM 13
85:- Added support for LLVM 15 and 16 (@MartinNowack)
86:- Removed support for LLVM <11 (@danielschemmel)
87:- KLEE 3.1 will be the last version with support for LLVM <13
88-
