91-- New --write-exec-tree and --exec-tree-batch-size options (@251)
92-- Renamed --compress-process-tree to --compress-exec-tree (@ccadar)
93-- PTree is now called ExecutionTree in the code (@ccadar)
94-- KDAlloc (--kdalloc) is now enabled by default (@ccadar)
95-- Replaced --suppress-exter
